{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Maddy's Meadow \u2014 a living world that grows and changes, whether you\u2019re there or not.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant a seed and watch an endless garden unfold. Flowers sway with the breeze, seasons drift by, and curious visitors wander through the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are no timers, no battles, no stress \u2014 just a beautiful, ever-evolving landscape to calm your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your meadow with rare flowers, gentle rains, pastel skies, and drifting leaves. Or simply sit back and let nature take its course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic weather and seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare visitors like bees, foxes, and fireflies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional planting and light customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable flowers and ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal input required \u2014 perfect for background beauty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow a little peace today. Your meadow is waiting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709880?t=1746684810","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709880/719945fbf086132bf3ffb5a13a8b6580d48c6590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746684810","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709880/6f0f24915df39d19f4c8e91b39f6e90f20d5c9af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746684810","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709880/6f0f24915df39d19f4c8e91b39f6e90f20d5c9af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746684810","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Maddy's Meadow \u2014 a living world that grows and changes, whether you\u2019re there or not.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant a seed and watch an endless garden unfold. Flowers sway with the breeze, seasons drift by, and curious visitors wander through the grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are no timers, no battles, no stress \u2014 just a beautiful, ever-evolving landscape to calm your mind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your meadow with rare flowers, gentle rains, pastel skies, and drifting leaves. Or simply sit back and let nature take its course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic weather and seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rare visitors like bees, foxes, and fireflies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional planting and light customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable flowers and ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal input required \u2014 perfect for background beauty</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow a little peace today. Your meadow is waiting.</p>","developers":["Frog Hammer"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Fabian Schaub ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709880/c34ff8347d497dcdd055360c0785a8f7e09705ff/header.jpg?t=1746684810","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136693,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136693/movie480.mp4?t=1746684808","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136693/movie_max.mp4?t=1746684808"},"name":"Early Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136693/ad27ac4